config BR2_PACKAGE_REGMSG_SDL2_PROBE
	bool "regmsg-sdl2-probe"
	depends on BR2_PACKAGE_SDL2
	help
	  Tiny SDL2 helper that enumerates game controllers the way an
	  SDL2 emulator sees them (HIDAPI on) and prints one JSON object
	  per pad. regmsgd runs it to learn each pad's true SDL device
	  index, which differs from the kernel jsN order when HIDAPI
	  claims a pad. Lets the launcher bind SDL-index emulators
	  (DuckStation, mupen64plus) to the correct controller.

	  https://github.com/REG-Linux/regmsg
